  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det via OPC &#xe4;r f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka lokalal organisationers demokratiska kultur, samt att st&#xe4;rka deras f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att fungera som ett aktivt civilt samh&#xe4;lle f&#xf6;r den demokratiska utvecklingen av Serbien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The mission of this programme is to increase citizens` influence and participation at all levels of society. The programme is intended to improve the democratic values within the civil society in particular as regards the involvement of citizens in the work of CSOs. It shall also improve civil society`s public communication with citizens</narrative>
  </description>
